  "caption": "Mandarin liquid drum and bass in the smooth London liquid-funk style. Rolling chopped breakbeat with crisp ghost snares; a deep round sub bass moving in half-time; Rhodes electric piano playing jazzy seventh chords; a warm analog pad swelling under the chorus; a soft clean electric guitar plucking short phrases. Smooth late-night mix, wide pads, crisp breaks and subby low end. Female voice, a soft close-miked alto singing conversationally, light double-track on the chorus. 172 BPM, D major. Warm, hushed and quietly giddy. No dubstep wobble, no neurofunk growl bass, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no big-room EDM drop.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - Rhodes chords and filtered breakbeat]\n\n[Verse 1]\n末班公車開過基隆路\n你靠著我說只睡一下下\n口罩歪一邊，耳機掉一隻\n你的頭髮有我們剛剛那碗麵的味道\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n廣播說下一站，是我們家\n\n[Chorus]\n我沒按鈴，我多坐兩站\n肩膀麻了也不想換\n窗外的燈一格一格倒退\n讓我再多愛你兩站\n\n[Verse 2]\n司機從鏡子裡看我一眼\n我比了一個噓，他把車開得好慢\n你在夢裡笑，說了一句聽不懂的話\n我猜那是在叫我名字\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n廣播說終點站，請全部下車\n\n[Chorus]\n我沒按鈴，我多坐兩站\n走回去要二十分鐘\n你醒來問這是哪裡\n我說剛好，剛好陪你走回家\n\n[Outro - pad and sub bass fade]\n下次你再睡著\n我們坐到底",
